(6183984, 913082, 83686, '<td valign="top">When I lived in Austin, years ago, I heard about this statue but never went to see it regrettably. I like the framing of the picture and the subject. The lighting seems to be around midday or mid-afternoon which really causes limited contrasts to the statue. The blown out buildings in the background are a nice touch but seem tilted. Black and white was a good choice as well. Anyway, knowing limited DPCers in the Austin area I would think that this is <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=33361" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">love</a>.</td>', 'When I lived in Austin, years ago, I heard about this statue but never went to see it regrettably. I like the framing of the picture and the subject. The lighting seems to be around midday or mid-afternoon which really causes limited contrasts to the statue. The blown out buildings in the background are a nice touch but seem tilted. Black and white was a good choice as well. Anyway, knowing limited DPCers in the Austin area I would think that this is  love.', '2010-10-06 21:50:09.000000', NULL, 1),
