(6186807, 913123, 103032, '<td valign="top">I think this is well done.  Good contrast/tones.  I think going B&amp;W was fitting and helps focus the viewer on the headstones and the symmetry of the image.  My top pick for the challenge.</td>', 'I think this is well done.  Good contrast/tones.  I think going B&W was fitting and helps focus the viewer on the headstones and the symmetry of the image.  My top pick for the challenge.', '2010-10-09 05:19:11.000000', NULL, 1),
