(6187747, 912037, 103069, '<td valign="top">creative idea.  nicely done</td>', 'creative idea.  nicely done', '2010-10-10 19:16:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6187750, 913109, 117955, '<td valign="top">I like the soft tones in this shot, but the lamps &amp; lamp reflections draw my eye away from the statue, and it is too dark in places &amp; the details are lost. Perhaps an early morning shot would have provided better light in general, without being too bright, so as to lose the mood. Also, if a different angle could have been used, as all the windows and power lines are distracting. Good effort, though.</td>', 'I like the soft tones in this shot, but the lamps & lamp reflections draw my eye away from the statue, and it is too dark in places & the details are lost. Perhaps an early morning shot would have provided better light in general, without being too bright, so as to lose the mood. Also, if a different angle could have been used, as all the windows and power lines are distracting. Good effort, though.', '2010-10-10 19:20:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6187753, 911949, 117955, '<td valign="top">The light here, and depth of field is pretty good. It is a shame, though, that we can''t see the face of the statue. Just IMO.</td>', 'The light here, and depth of field is pretty good. It is a shame, though, that we can''t see the face of the statue. Just IMO.', '2010-10-10 19:22:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6187755, 912529, 117955, '<td valign="top">The crop is good, but cuts off the point of the archway; otherwise I like it.</td>', 'The crop is good, but cuts off the point of the archway; otherwise I like it.', '2010-10-10 19:24:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6187760, 912319, 117955, '<td valign="top">Good color, but we are looking at this from behind. Perhaps it wasn''t possible to get that view that day. Also, the corps in the background is a bit distracting &amp; draws my eye away from the subject. I would have left out as much of the foreground as possible, and tried either early in the a.m. or late p.m. for softer light.</td>', 'Good color, but we are looking at this from behind. Perhaps it wasn''t possible to get that view that day. Also, the corps in the background is a bit distracting & draws my eye away from the subject. I would have left out as much of the foreground as possible, and tried either early in the a.m. or late p.m. for softer light.', '2010-10-10 19:29:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6187761, 912781, 117955, '<td valign="top">Simply Lovely! This one''s in my top 5.</td>', 'Simply Lovely! This one''s in my top 5.', '2010-10-10 19:30:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6187762, 912821, 117955, '<td valign="top">Good composition on this one. Its a little bright, but otherwise I like it!</td>', 'Good composition on this one. Its a little bright, but otherwise I like it!', '2010-10-10 19:31:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6187763, 912475, 117955, '<td valign="top">Love all the texture. I think I just would like to see more of the stones for more impact -- just my opinion, you know!</td>', 'Love all the texture. I think I just would like to see more of the stones for more impact -- just my opinion, you know!', '2010-10-10 19:33:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6187764, 913123, 117955, '<td valign="top">Was this infrared? It is beautiful! Great repetition and symmetry. One of my top 5!</td>', 'Was this infrared? It is beautiful! Great repetition and symmetry. One of my top 5!', '2010-10-10 19:34:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6187766, 913031, 117955, '<td valign="top">this one needs to have been taken and cropped much more closely, as we can see no detail on the subject.</td>', 'this one needs to have been taken and cropped much more closely, as we can see no detail on the subject.', '2010-10-10 19:35:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6187769, 913057, 117955, '<td valign="top">Composition could be better -- image is crooked and the top of the flag is cut off, as well as the baby''s arm and leg. Focus is also off. I would try it again from ground level, i.e., be low to the ground with your camera; take your time and compose for impact! Maybe you could have the child sitting in front of the subject, looking at the camera:) Good luck and please keep trying -- you are on the right track!</td>', 'Composition could be better -- image is crooked and the top of the flag is cut off, as well as the baby''s arm and leg. Focus is also off. I would try it again from ground level, i.e., be low to the ground with your camera; take your time and compose for impact! Maybe you could have the child sitting in front of the subject, looking at the camera:) Good luck and please keep trying -- you are on the right track!', '2010-10-10 19:40:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6187774, 912494, 117955, '<td valign="top">This is quite nice. Good contrast and depth of field. I think, though, that I would really like to see this in portrait mode, so that the Angel''s hands are not cut off, or perhaps cropped just a little further on the bottom, right at the elbow. The great part is that the subject really pops!</td>', 'This is quite nice. Good contrast and depth of field. I think, though, that I would really like to see this in portrait mode, so that the Angel''s hands are not cut off, or perhaps cropped just a little further on the bottom, right at the elbow. The great part is that the subject really pops!', '2010-10-10 19:47:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6187775, 913082, 117955, '<td valign="top">I like the composition here. I would like to see a little more contrast, a lot more depth of field, and fewer shadows. I do like this, though... and love SRV.</td>', 'I like the composition here. I would like to see a little more contrast, a lot more depth of field, and fewer shadows. I do like this, though... and love SRV.', '2010-10-10 19:52:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6187777, 913085, 117955, '<td valign="top">Unfortunately, the bottom of the building is cut off. This is a beautiful building/shrine, and I would have concentrated on that and the details, and left out the plane.  Just my opinion though. The sky and color is good.</td>', 'Unfortunately, the bottom of the building is cut off. This is a beautiful building/shrine, and I would have concentrated on that and the details, and left out the plane.  Just my opinion though. The sky and color is good.', '2010-10-10 19:56:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6187778, 912881, 117955, '<td valign="top">One of my top five!</td>', 'One of my top five!', '2010-10-10 19:58:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6187779, 912499, 117955, '<td valign="top">basic editing? i think not!</td>', 'basic editing? i think not!', '2010-10-10 20:00:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6187781, 913124, 117955, '<td valign="top">good composition on this one. not too much sky, not too much foreground. I really like this!</td>', 'good composition on this one. not too much sky, not too much foreground. I really like this!', '2010-10-10 20:05:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6187784, 912552, 117955, '<td valign="top">I would like this much better without the other photographer in the shot. Otherwise, it is beautiful.</td>', 'I would like this much better without the other photographer in the shot. Otherwise, it is beautiful.', '2010-10-10 20:07:27.000000', NULL, 1),
