(6187786, 912434, 117955, '<td valign="top">I like this one a lot. I would like to see it cropped a little more closely. The sidewalk in the foreground is distracting and takes away from the subject. I would move that bottom crop up to just below the planter on the left, and take just a little bit off the top as well. Otherwise, I like it!</td>', 'I like this one a lot. I would like to see it cropped a little more closely. The sidewalk in the foreground is distracting and takes away from the subject. I would move that bottom crop up to just below the planter on the left, and take just a little bit off the top as well. Otherwise, I like it!', '2010-10-10 20:12:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6187787, 912591, 117955, '<td valign="top">Nice composition. Only thing different I would have done is cropped out all the sidewalk in the foreground, as it doesn''t contribute much to the image (just imho). Nice!</td>', 'Nice composition. Only thing different I would have done is cropped out all the sidewalk in the foreground, as it doesn''t contribute much to the image (just imho). Nice!', '2010-10-10 20:14:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6187792, 913036, 117955, '<td valign="top">the light &amp; focus are on the plant in the foreground, instead of on the subject angel. I would have come in much closer to the subject and only included a small portion of the leaves from the plant to sort of close the left corner, as it were. Also, a brighter time of day would be beneficial. Keep trying, though. We all have to start somewhere!</td>', 'the light & focus are on the plant in the foreground, instead of on the subject angel. I would have come in much closer to the subject and only included a small portion of the leaves from the plant to sort of close the left corner, as it were. Also, a brighter time of day would be beneficial. Keep trying, though. We all have to start somewhere!', '2010-10-10 20:16:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6187794, 912293, 117955, '<td valign="top">good light, focus &amp; comp are good. like it!</td>', 'good light, focus & comp are good. like it!', '2010-10-10 20:17:55.000000', NULL, 1),
