(6189563, 912881, 3214, '<td valign="top">Wow, this one is ribbon worthy although I don''t care for the heavy inner border, think it would stand on high by itself.  The square crop really works. Love how you shot towards the sky.  As a horse photographer, you really picked a great angle.</td>', 'Wow, this one is ribbon worthy although I don''t care for the heavy inner border, think it would stand on high by itself.  The square crop really works. Love how you shot towards the sky.  As a horse photographer, you really picked a great angle.', '2010-10-12 17:50:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6189566, 912529, 3214, '<td valign="top">Great job with the texture and perspective.</td>', 'Great job with the texture and perspective.', '2010-10-12 17:54:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6189570, 913049, 3214, '<td valign="top">Only a handful stand out in this challenge, this is one of them.  Love the tint from your time of day as well as the perspective.</td>', 'Only a handful stand out in this challenge, this is one of them.  Love the tint from your time of day as well as the perspective.', '2010-10-12 17:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6189572, 913151, 3214, '<td valign="top">How very refreshing.</td>', 'How very refreshing.', '2010-10-12 17:58:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6189602, 912781, 98339, '<td valign="top">Now that is well done, I''ve been here and this is a very difficult Monument to photograph...where is this reflecting pool?  I''m usually in St. Louis in April, would love to get a shot of this...really good</td>', 'Now that is well done, I''ve been here and this is a very difficult Monument to photograph...where is this reflecting pool?  I''m usually in St. Louis in April, would love to get a shot of this...really good', '2010-10-12 18:25:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6189608, 912494, 98339, '<td valign="top">extremely well done...very good balance and tones</td>', 'extremely well done...very good balance and tones', '2010-10-12 18:32:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6189609, 913108, 98339, '<td valign="top">I like the perspective of this...excellent job</td>', 'I like the perspective of this...excellent job', '2010-10-12 18:33:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6189705, 913089, 103142, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. It''s a bit noisy, however. I''d be curious to see what it looked like off center (but centering doesn''t bother me.)</td>', 'Nice shot. It''s a bit noisy, however. I''d be curious to see what it looked like off center (but centering doesn''t bother me.)', '2010-10-12 20:29:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6189710, 913023, 103142, '<td valign="top">I like this quite a bit, but I find the noise very distracting (doesn''t seem to fit.) I think it would benefit from denoising.</td>', 'I like this quite a bit, but I find the noise very distracting (doesn''t seem to fit.) I think it would benefit from denoising.', '2010-10-12 20:33:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6189739, 912781, 59796, '<td valign="top">Great time of the day to be shooting this. And a fantastic reflection to boot!<br/>Turns out, in my top 5 this is the only color shot :) Hope it ribbons.</td>', 'Great time of the day to be shooting this. And a fantastic reflection to boot!Turns out, in my top 5 this is the only color shot :) Hope it ribbons.', '2010-10-12 21:25:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6189742, 912037, 59796, '<td valign="top">Crisp clouds, the solar star burst, and an interesting angle make this a very nice shot. Hope this ribbons. I would''ve probably liked better if the sun was behind the head - kind of a halo, but this works pretty well.</td>', 'Crisp clouds, the solar star burst, and an interesting angle make this a very nice shot. Hope this ribbons. I would''ve probably liked better if the sun was behind the head - kind of a halo, but this works pretty well.', '2010-10-12 21:27:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6189743, 912977, 59796, '<td valign="top">Interesting use of negative space - I would''ve probably cropped it as much as I could to take the stairs out, but I''m surprised to see that this composition actually is pretty good - probably because of the gentle curve at the top naturally pointing to the monument - which looks awesome in that light. My top 10.</td>', 'Interesting use of negative space - I would''ve probably cropped it as much as I could to take the stairs out, but I''m surprised to see that this composition actually is pretty good - probably because of the gentle curve at the top naturally pointing to the monument - which looks awesome in that light. My top 10.', '2010-10-12 21:30:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6189762, 912434, 117285, '<td valign="top">I''ve driven by enough times but have yet to visit it in person but I''ve been there many times in my mind thanks to Stan Rogers</td>', 'I''ve driven by enough times but have yet to visit it in person but I''ve been there many times in my mind thanks to Stan Rogers', '2010-10-12 21:58:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6189763, 912543, 117285, '<td valign="top">Nice angle</td>', 'Nice angle', '2010-10-12 21:59:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6189765, 912037, 117285, '<td valign="top">Way to make a boring sculpture photograph way more interesting</td>', 'Way to make a boring sculpture photograph way more interesting', '2010-10-12 22:01:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6189767, 913140, 117285, '<td valign="top">Well done</td>', 'Well done', '2010-10-12 22:02:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6189771, 913123, 117285, '<td valign="top">Nice choice with the monotone.  Is it infrared?</td>', 'Nice choice with the monotone.  Is it infrared?', '2010-10-12 22:05:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6189773, 912821, 117285, '<td valign="top">Nice choice</td>', 'Nice choice', '2010-10-12 22:06:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6189774, 912781, 117285, '<td valign="top">Nice balance</td>', 'Nice balance', '2010-10-12 22:06:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6189782, 913108, 117285, '<td valign="top">Nice tones</td>', 'Nice tones', '2010-10-12 22:13:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6189786, 912920, 117285, '<td valign="top">Maybe a little too tightly cropped</td>', 'Maybe a little too tightly cropped', '2010-10-12 22:18:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6189819, 912494, 27662, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, moving photograph!!!!</td>', 'Beautiful, moving photograph!!!!', '2010-10-12 23:18:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6189862, 913059, 50695, '<td valign="top">The emotional impact of this photo is staggering, a sort of one-two punch because it takes a moment to realize what you are seeing, or at least what you think you are seeing. The ambiguous but powerful messages appeal to a poet.<br/> <br/>I''m giving you a Posthumous Blue Ribbon.<br/> <br/><img alt="'' . substr(''//blackyak.com/dpc/bluepost.jpg'', strrpos(''//blackyak.com/dpc/bluepost.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//blackyak.com/dpc/bluepost.jpg"/></td>', 'The emotional impact of this photo is staggering, a sort of one-two punch because it takes a moment to realize what you are seeing, or at least what you think you are seeing. The ambiguous but powerful messages appeal to a poet. I''m giving you a Posthumous Blue Ribbon. ', '2010-10-12 23:52:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6189864, 913103, 50695, '<td valign="top">Creepy clever.</td>', 'Creepy clever.', '2010-10-12 23:52:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6189867, 913109, 50695, '<td valign="top">I like the composition, color, energy... just a good photograph.</td>', 'I like the composition, color, energy... just a good photograph.', '2010-10-12 23:53:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6189869, 912992, 50695, '<td valign="top">Norman Bates would like this photo. Posthumous Red Ribbon<br/> <br/><img alt="'' . substr(''//blackyak.com/dpc/redpost.jpg'', strrpos(''//blackyak.com/dpc/redpost.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//blackyak.com/dpc/redpost.jpg"/></td>', 'Norman Bates would like this photo. Posthumous Red Ribbon ', '2010-10-12 23:53:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6189878, 912963, 33361, '<td valign="top">Cool!!</td>', 'Cool!!', '2010-10-13 00:02:47.000000', NULL, 1),
