(6190071, 912781, 60047, '<td valign="top">As a kid, I always referred to this monument as "The Great Arch." How fitting that the photographer''s name is Archer!<br/> <br/>Great work, here.</td>', 'As a kid, I always referred to this monument as "The Great Arch." How fitting that the photographer''s name is Archer! Great work, here.', '2010-10-13 01:45:58.000000', NULL, 0),
