(6197063, 913108, 59796, '<td valign="top">lol - you''re right. I remember thinking the soldier/horse combo and the perspective is similar during the voting. Didn''t realize it was with an A700 as well :) Congrats on yet another ribbon.<br/>Very cool username btw - I''ll get there soon and will find out if it''s true :)<br/>And thanks for your pointer about recovering images from the CF after they''re deleted. I now have the software required - should I need it in the future.</td>', 'lol - you''re right. I remember thinking the soldier/horse combo and the perspective is similar during the voting. Didn''t realize it was with an A700 as well :) Congrats on yet another ribbon.Very cool username btw - I''ll get there soon and will find out if it''s true :)And thanks for your pointer about recovering images from the CF after they''re deleted. I now have the software required - should I need it in the future.', '2010-10-20 17:42:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(6603010, 913049, 101668, '<td valign="top">Het nou vir die eerste keer na jou profielblad gekyk en jy het mighty mooi fotos hier geneem. So lekker om iemand te he wat jou kan leer en so gaaf dat jy van jongs af bereid is om te leer. Hierdie is pragtig. Ek sal ook graag eendag sulke fotos wil neem! baie geluk met die elfde plek.</td>', 'Het nou vir die eerste keer na jou profielblad gekyk en jy het mighty mooi fotos hier geneem. So lekker om iemand te he wat jou kan leer en so gaaf dat jy van jongs af bereid is om te leer. Hierdie is pragtig. Ek sal ook graag eendag sulke fotos wil neem! baie geluk met die elfde plek.', '2011-11-25 00:56:25.000000', NULL, 0),
